{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:44:49.226Z","ordinal":311154,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add26cdcad881a096e9b3f7ff9b3051","status":"completed","call_id":"call_b5e23419e4e64864b2ce6750019d8c8d","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy/docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md\\n@@\\n-| REQ-SEC-119 | Audit; DEC-01 (amended 2026-10-24) | Nexus-initiated verifier runs are `exec` class and follow configured permission mode; review requires a one-time approval showing the script body. Folder trust alone does not authorize execution; all runs are routed through the runner. | safety | `agent.ts:1654,3544,4255`; `tester.ts:145`; `verifier_gating.test.ts` | TEST `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\\\"repo in review mode prompts for verifier and script body, writes sentinel only after approval, and caches session decision\\\"`; `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\\\"denied verifier does not execute verifier and sentinel is not written\\\"`; `test:cli/test/harness.test.ts::\\\"run_tests keeps repository test side effects inside worktree authority and honors read-only, dry-run, and required sandbox\\\"`; PTY ACC-SAFE-09/10 still pending | partial | ACC-SAFE-09, ACC-SAFE-10 | **B** | VER-01, VER-14 | SPEC-01 / PLAN-01 |\\n+| REQ-SEC-119 | Audit; DEC-01 (amended 2026-10-24) | Nexus-initiated verifier runs are `exec` class and follow configured permission mode; review requires a one-time approval showing the script body. Folder trust alone does not authorize execution; all runs are routed through the runner. | safety | `agent.ts:1654,3544,4255`; `tester.ts:145`; `verifier_gating.test.ts` | TEST `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\\\"trusted repo in review mode prompts for verifier and script body, writes sentinel only after approval, and caches session decision\\\"`; `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\\\"untrusted repo in review mode prompts