{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:52:45.626Z","ordinal":311441,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add28aaa45081a0b0503a42baac94ac","status":"completed","call_id":"call_4b5fb7b28ff04c0d98aab03f90987be2","name":"exec","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"cat > /tmp/nexus-startup-trust-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\\n## Summary\\n\\n- Keep folder trust limited to loading project instructions and integrations; it does not change tool approval mode.\\n- Default unset approval mode to review in trusted and untrusted workspaces, with permission settings controlling approvals independently.\\n- Make headless approval guidance effect-specific and update user/security/release documentation.\\n- Add regression coverage for approval policy and verifier behavior. Keep REQ-SEC-101 and REQ-SEC-119 partial while PTY acceptance remains pending.\\n\\n## Validation\\n\\n- Focused approval/config/startup/verifier tests: 39/39 passed under isolated HOME.\\n- `npx tsc --noEmit`: passed.\\n- `npm run build`: passed on code-identical source before documentation-only evidence corrections.\\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\\n- Requirements enforcement on clean candidate: correctly fails only REQ-SEC-101 and REQ-SEC-119, both partial pending PTY acceptance.\\n- Independent review: ACCEPT at `5b8f4ebf68fd9c5d016f342a1a7c5e948e20b16f`, diff SHA-256 `e07d47052ecc8ef37f5ad5c0d9d174de0a289f19d0c6e87e216bd3591c647251`.\\n- Exact base `4b474f1638645258fc6bc696400892feaf3a78d6` CI run `40133356557` and CodeQL run `40133356577`: all successful.\\n\\nInstalled-RC qualification and the required PTY acceptance checks are not claimed complete by this PR.\\nEOF\\ngh pr create --base main --head codex/startup-folder-trust-copy-20261024 --title \\\"Keep folder trust separate from tool approvals\\\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-startup-trust-pr-body.md\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy\",\"yield_time_ms\":30000,\"max_output_tokens\":1000}); text(r.output);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a16fd6-d88e-7ad0-8956-d61230292d9e","create_time":1792878762.6430535}}}
