{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:54:09.641Z","ordinal":311492,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a16fd6-d88e-7ad0-8956-d61230292d9e","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add29011d6881a09acba3f9a51bc837","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"PR CI caught a real ledger/test-reference mismatch before any test suite ran: the test checker only validates literal test titles, while these cases generate their names from a template. I’m fixing the test to use one literal title that explicitly covers both trusted and untrusted workspaces, preserving the same verifier-approval and sentinel assertions, then I’ll rerun the focused checks and refresh review/CI."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792878849147,"completed_at_ms":1792878849641}}
