.test.ts::\"denied verifier does not execute verifier and sentinel is not written\"`; `test:cli/test/harness.test.ts::\"run_tests keeps repository test side effects inside worktree authority and honors read-only, dry-run, and required sandbox\"`; PTY ACC-SAFE-09/10 still pending | partial | ACC-SAFE-09, ACC-SAFE-10 | **B** | VER-01, VER-14 | SPEC-01 / PLAN-01 |\n+| REQ-SEC-119 | Audit; DEC-01 (amended 2026-10-24) | Nexus-initiated verifier runs are `exec` class and follow configured permission mode; review requires a one-time approval showing the script body. Folder trust alone does not authorize execution; all runs are routed through the runner. | safety | `agent.ts:1654,3544,4255`; `tester.ts:145`; `verifier_gating.test.ts` | TEST `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\"trusted and untrusted repos in review mode prompt for verifier and script body, write sentinel only after approval, and cache session decision\"`; `test:cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts::\"denied verifier does not execute verifier and sentinel is not written\"`; `test:cli/test/harness.test.ts::\"run_tests keeps repository test side effects inside worktree authority and honors read-only, dry-run, and required sandbox\"`; PTY ACC-SAFE-09/10 still pending | partial | ACC-SAFE-09, ACC-SAFE-10 | **B** | VER-01, VER-14 | SPEC-01 / PLAN-01 |\n | REQ-SEC-104 | Audit | `--read-only` cannot read outside the workspace through commands. HOME is masked. | safety | `sandbox.ts`, `core/authority.ts:44-136` | RT (SEC-04) | tested | ACC-SAFE-04 | RR | SEC-04 | SPEC-01 / PLAN-01 |\n | REQ-TUI-102 | Audit | The startup banner states mode, sandbox and trust. Doctor reports the posture. | safety / UX | `sidecar.ts`, `live_view.rs`, `repl.ts`, `doctor.ts` | TEST `tui_surface_e2e.test.ts`, `doctor.test.ts` | tested | ACC-SAFE-06 | RR | TUI-07 | SPEC-01 / PLAN-01 |\n | REQ-SEC-108 | Audit | The command denylist is labelled a tripwire, and its false positives are fixed. | honesty / workflow | `security.ts`, `runner.rs:64