arget Head**: `18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5`\\n- **Base Commit**: `41b381ddac182b7f0c783b33df5f1355518f465b` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Idempotent Fail-Closed Git Exclusion**:\\n   - `ensureGitExclude` checks `isIgnored` using `git check-ignore --quiet --no-index`.\\n   - If an exact exclusion rule already exists in `info/exclude` without subsequent negation lines, but Git still reports the path as not ignored (e.g., overridden by a higher-priority repository ignore rule such as in `.gitignore`), it immediately fails closed by throwing an error without continually appending duplicate useless rules to `info/exclude`.\\n   - If a subsequent negation (`!`) is present in `info/exclude`, it appends the verified positive rule to re-establish exclusion and validates ignore status.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (1.03s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`41b381d`): **CLEAN** (`141a1df2122886d1d7a4c9fa71c64668153ff058`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40116819484](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819484): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40116819381](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40116819381): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T17:42:47Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"18abef6e6e43d3b1a23f761128f808a5cd2bc7f5\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCDT_A\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `56bc1dc`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362`\\n- **Base Commit**: `676abb371c8c91970af6d920d5c516497e3ccdef` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Preserved Explicit Subpath Exclusions**:\\n   - Condition updated to `if (hasExactRule && isIgnored(relativePath)) continue;`, ensuring that explicit rules for `.nexus/worktrees/` and `.nexus/flights/` are always written even when Git's parent path resolution already considers them covered by `.nexus/`.\\n   - Idempotency and fail-closed protections are fully maintained: if `hasExactRule` is true and a non-negated rule still fails to ignore the target (e.g., due to repository-level `.gitignore` override), it fails closed without growing `info/exclude`.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - `test/flight_exclude.test.ts` (3/3): **PASS** (WorktreeManager exclusions and idempotency verified).\\n     - `test/git_exclude.test.ts` (8/8): **PASS** (11/11 total tests across suites in 2.61s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against `origin/main` (`676abb3`): **CLEAN** (`ac3e5d3856f364e5f17aedef12d7c881f9aa009b`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40118387755](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387755): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m14s.\\n   - CI Run [40118387758](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40118387758): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:01:15Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"56bc1dcef066bae949e7ebe04346a45cb60bf362\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCKBlg\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Rebased Head `89d7416`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `89d7416fc5a54e3d0d9fd43d70192f12c540f93f`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts` and `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Rebase Integrity**:\\n   - Clean rebase onto `main@4adc61a`, resolving base divergence after merge of PR #199.\\n   - Preserves all 11 explicit Nexus exclude tests, idempotence assertions, and `hasExactRule && isIgnored` logic.\\n2. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`4c131f12886d01af438ed29825de8527d8479d42`).\\n3. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120298213](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298213): active.\\n   - CI Run [40120298254](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298254): active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:23:14Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"89d7416fc5a54e3d0d9fd43d70192f12c540f93f\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCOZhQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `dfea9e2`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `dfea9e2d9361adbcab662a6e9a66d8ba0e2e5dfb`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (`origin/main`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts`, `cli/src/worktree.ts`, `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`, and `cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Deferred Exclusion Mutation**:\\n   - `WorktreeManager` construction is now strictly read-only with respect to Git metadata (`.git/info/exclude`), preserving the invariant that starting a Nexus session does not prematurely mutate repo state.\\n   - Exclusion is executed immediately prior to actual workspace state creation in `createWorktree()`.\\n   - New regression tests verify:\\n     - `WorktreeManager defers .nexus exclusion until it creates workspace state`: verifies initial metadata untouched on construction, then excluded upon `createWorktree()`.\\n     - `unavailable exclude metadata does not prevent startup and fails before worktree state is written`: verifies preflight failure prevents creating `.nexus` workspace directory.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - 12/12 `flight_exclude` and `git_exclude` tests: **PASS** (1.49s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`4adc61a`): **CLEAN** (`b43729e2467d341990c0ef497cb730c4e09ef2be`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40120298213](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40120298213): **`✓ SUCCESS`**.\\n   - CI Run: active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T18:46:02Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"dfea9e2f010f194718f01e9da13fed7dbd80d069\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCRghQ\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `506cf11`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `506cf1150859d496e1ee5f2fe31bdade3d23e65a`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468`\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts`, `cli/src/worktree.ts`, `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`, and `cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Self-Contained Ignore Invariant**:\\n   - Creates a dedicated `.nexus/.gitignore` containing `*` (mode 0o600) via `ensurePrivateDir`, ensuring that repository-level `.gitignore` negations (e.g. `!.nexus/`) cannot expose runtime state, flight logs, or worktree checkpoints.\\n   - Enforces symlink and hard-link defenses before any write (`stat.isSymbolicLink()`, `stat.nlink > 1`).\\n   - Retains `.git/info/exclude` as best-effort convenience for status output and external tools while tolerating read-only Git directories.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - 16/16 tests pass across `flight_exclude.test.ts` and `git_exclude.test.ts` (1.56s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`29eab4c`): **CLEAN** (`c663f721e7798363717df3029a1b023f044bb4c0`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40122822765](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40122822765): active.\\n   - CI Run: active.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:01:11Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"506cf1150859d496e1ee5f2fe31bdade3d23e65a\"}},{\"id\":\"PRR_kwDOVGxXKc8AAAABUCTe5w\",\"author\":{\"login\":\"mikeholownych\"},\"authorAssociation\":\"OWNER\",\"body\":\"### Independent Review: ACCEPT (Updated Head `a568a0d`)\\n\\n- **Target Head**: `a568a0da3c032576e7dbb96f02cbfddbcd61bcc3`\\n- **Base Commit**: `4adc61ac98616c5e1dccaf6065e7f2332443d468` (merges cleanly with current `origin/main` at `29eab4c`)\\n- **Safe Change Boundary**: `cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts`, `cli/src/worktree.ts`, `cli/test/git_exclude.test.ts`, and `cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts`.\\n\\n#### Findings & Verification\\n1. **Fixture Isolation Hardening (`a568a0d`)**:\\n   - `cli/test/flight_exclude.test.ts` wraps the nested workspace exclude test in a `try ... finally` block ensuring `excludePath` permissions are restored from read-only `0o444` to writable `0o600` and the temporary worktree is discarded, preventing fixture pollution or teardown permission errors across test suites.\\n2. **Local Regression Testing**:\\n   - Verified in isolated worktree with sandboxed `$HOME`/`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME`:\\n     - 17/17 tests pass across `flight_exclude.test.ts` and `git_exclude.test.ts` (2.27s).\\n     - `tsc --noEmit`: **PASS** (0 errors).\\n3. **Static & Integrity Checks**:\\n   - `git diff --check`: **PASS** (0 whitespace anomalies).\\n   - Clean 3-way merge against current `origin/main` (`29eab4c`): **CLEAN** (`51e292a3dd0634326ec29923923efa1e6e7be9ce`).\\n4. **Hosted CI**:\\n   - CodeQL Run [40123934739](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40123934739): **`✓ SUCCESS`** in 1m17s.\\n   - CI Run [40123934735](https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40123934735): active in test-matrix.\\n\\n**Disposition**: **ACCEPT**.\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-10-24T19:11:30Z\",\"includesCreatedEdit\":false,\"reactionGroups\":[],\"state\":\"COMMENTED\",\"commit\":{\"oid\":\"a568a0da3c032576e7dbb96f02cbfddbcd61bcc3\"}}]}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":659685029}},"started_at_ms":1792884342052,"completed_at_ms":1792884342717}}
