{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:27:59.459Z","ordinal":313644,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add3efe85e881a0b39ce95399ac0336","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The broader targeted run exposed two genuine weaknesses in the race-test harness: it patches Node’s default `fs` export, but `safe_fs.ts` uses ESM namespace imports, so those patches don’t reach the implementation. The other doctor-test failures were packaged-launch checks run from an archive without the required build artifact, so they are inconclusive. I’m correcting the race tests to synchronize Node’s built-in ESM exports, then I’ll rerun just the affected tests with the required setup."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792884478554,"completed_at_ms":1792884479458}}
