{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:30:03.414Z","ordinal":313772,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-db130ae8-240a-4e2a-a9b6-9c0f5036ae6a","process_id":"33745","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat > /var/tmp/pr200-current-main-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis is a no-force, current-main replacement candidate for the fail-closed Nexus state exclusion and verified filesystem cleanup work in PR #200. It is based on `main` at `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63`; the candidate head is `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e`.\n\nThe existing PR #200 remains open so its history and old-head evidence are preserved. Its head is stale, and its hosted Node 22/24 jobs have remained in `npm test` without a conclusion since 2026-10-24 20:38Z. Those jobs are not counted as passing evidence. This PR should be reviewed and checked on its exact head before deciding whether to close or supersede #200.\n\n## Validation on an isolated snapshot\n\n- `git_exclude.test.ts` + `flight_exclude.test.ts`: 21/21 passed.\n- The two `doctor.test.ts` safe-filesystem race regressions: 2/2 passed after correcting the ESM built-in test hooks with `syncBuiltinESMExports()`.\n- TypeScript `--noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- The full suite was not run. A broader doctor test invocation without the packaged build prerequisites was inconclusive and is recorded as such.\n\nPlease perform an independent review of this exact candidate and run the required exact-head CI. No acceptance or release qualification is claimed by this PR.\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed-current-main-20261025 --title \"fix(git): safely exclude Nexus workspace state\" --body-file /var/tmp/pr200-current-main-body.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat > /var/tmp/pr200-current-main-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\nThis is a no-force, current-main replacement candidate for the fail-closed Nexus state exclusion and verified filesystem cleanup work in PR #200. It is based on `main` at `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63`; the candidate head is `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e`.\n\nThe existing PR #200 remains open so its history and old-head evidence are preserved. Its head is stale, and its hosted Node 22/24 jobs have remained in `npm test` without a conclusion since 2026-10-24 20:38Z. Those jobs are not counted as passing evidence. This PR should be reviewed and checked on its exact head before deciding whether to close or supersede #200.\n\n## Validation on an isolated snapshot\n\n- `git_exclude.test.ts` + `flight_exclude.test.ts`: 21/21 passed.\n- The two `doctor.test.ts` safe-filesystem race regressions: 2/2 passed after correcting the ESM built-in test hooks with `syncBuiltinESMExports()`.\n- TypeScript `--noEmit`: passed.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n- The full suite was not run. A broader doctor test invocation without the packaged build prerequisites was inconclusive and is recorded as such.\n\nPlease perform an independent review of this exact candidate and run the required exact-head CI. No acceptance or release qualification is claimed by this PR.\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/defect-git-exclude-fail-closed-current-main-20261025 --title \"fix(git): safely exclude Nexus workspace state\" --body-file /var/tmp/pr200-current-main-body.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/207\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":2,"nanos":241279057}},"started_at_ms":1792884601172,"completed_at_ms":1792884603414}}
