{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:34:37.138Z","ordinal":313955,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a17044-2752-7e93-9155-48c2321ec463","author":"/root/pr207_independent_review","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/pr207_independent_review\nPayload:\n**PR #207 review: CHANGES_REQUIRED**\n\nReviewed head `8e5fc70f9423b6e5b889aad249b4f2b9a0479a4e` against base `c1b13327edf5d3a0c82fb10eb814775fd4953a63`.\n\nDescriptor verification leaves a post-open race: a concurrent same-user process can move the containing directory after verification but before `writeSync`, so the write may reach a file moved outside the intended boundary. This affects [git_exclude.ts](/var/tmp/nexus-pr200-rebased-build/cli/src/core/git_exclude.ts:50) and [safe_fs.ts](/var/tmp/nexus-pr200-rebased-build/cli/src/safe_fs.ts:174). The new fixtures cover swaps before opening, but not after descriptor verification and before mutation.\n\n`git diff --check` was clean. I inspected the diff and ran an isolated Git ignore probe; I did not run tests or suites."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","create_time":1792884877.1382792}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15871}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:34:40.526Z","ordinal":313956,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add408f7ca081a0ab7d27e7a1011312","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Folder trust and tool permissions will remain separate, with the startup default set to **Review**. I’m resuming the release work from the current recorded state. The full suite is already running under its SUITE claim; an independent review also found a post-open filesystem race in PR #207, so that change cannot be merged as-is.\n\nOne workspace note: claude-mem’s automatic capture is paused because its weekly usage reached 96%; this does not block repository work. I’ll verify live claims and processes before touching the PR candidate."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792884879504,"completed_at_ms":1792884880526}}
