{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:39:30.731Z","ordinal":314196,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add41b1c70081a0a913f3e980d1e2cd","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I isolated the RC4 reproducibility failure: packaged file contents match, but GNU tar 1.34 and 1.35 encode unused PAX header fields differently. The pinned Bookworm tar already produces an archive byte-for-byte identical to the published RC4 artifact. The current packaging script contains that fix, but the old repro workflow checks out RC4’s older script, so the fix is not exercised there. I’m updating the repro path to use the reviewed main-branch packaging tool while keeping the product source bound to the exact RC tag, and recording that tool identity in the evidence."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792885169817,"completed_at_ms":1792885170731}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-24T23:39:30.735Z","ordinal":314197,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add41b1c70081a0a913f3e980d1e2cd","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I isolated the RC4 reproducibility failure: packaged file contents match, but GNU tar 1.34 and 1.35 encode unused PAX header fields differently. The pinned Bookworm tar already produces an archive byte-for-byte identical to the published RC4 artifact. The current packaging script contains that fix, but the old repro workflow checks out RC4’s older script, so the fix is not exercised there. I’m updating the repro path to use the reviewed main-branch packaging tool while keeping the product source bound to the exact RC tag, and recording that tool identity in the evidence.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","create_time":1792885169.7793427,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add41b1c70081a0a913f3e980d1e2cd","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17048-a22e-7d61-a3d4-06d61ee06162","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":15879}}
