 --check` passed.\n- Guard probe accepted the current lock-based source and rejected the published `v1.0.0-rc.3` source.\n- Main CI and CodeQL passed on base `3baee76736a21d6244f9f816bb8c2e148e4bab70`.\n\n{\n  \"agent\": \"codex-root\",\n  \"host\": \"mike-dev\",\n  \"branch\": \"v1/rc3-cross-runner-repro\",\n  \"worktree\": \"/home/mike/nexus-wt/rc3-cross-runner-repro\",\n  \"base\": \"3baee76736a21d6244f9f816bb8c2e148e4bab70\",\n  \"head\": \"a43da0cb22885fbb6460d200ecf5f70cf28350e6\",\n  \"since\": \"2026-10-24T03:35:00Z\",\n  \"scope\": \"Fix PR #180 exact workflow commit binding and ensure fetched RC tag peels to the source commit; focused tests only\",\n  \"status\": \"candidate merged with current main; focused tests pass 4/4; actionlint, syntax, diff checks pass; final independent review and exact-head CI pending\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-24T03:38:00Z\"\n}\n0c7c2f1 fix(release): bind repro evidence to workflow and tag commits\na4c130d ci(release): restore complete RC repro evidence\n4e7df7e fix(release): use supported pinned Rust builder\n20d47c9 fix(release): pin reproducible Rust build environment\n8bb1c11 ci(repro): record non-ignored untracked files in the source identity\n9b5623e ci(repro): bind evidence to the RC workflow and re-check source after packaging\n9dd2b99 ci(repro): make cross-runner RC source identity fail-closed\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":295160752}},"started_at_ms":1792885246246,"completed_at_ms":1792885247544}}
