d gateway model now advisory with --deep verification. Remaining measured D1b: async serial lstat over 53,376 entries still makes integrity.check exceed 5s and warn. Focused concurrent-batch fix underway; not yet tested., doctor_d1b_pr=PR #155 opened at https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/155; head 76b34f1d18d766b06011176a85679e7c3434ba30, base 382e0182795ad08332c30a7f798b94c525f8f068. Independent review ACCEPT. Focused doctor tests 5/5 and tsc --noEmit pass. Exact PR CI run39893335185 and CodeQL39893335167 in progress. No merge yet., main_latest_ci=Run39891501513 exact main 382e018: Node22 and Node24 full suites SUCCESS; Linux package job still in progress. CodeQL39891501527 SUCCESS. Prior PR153 post-merge run39891244410 on 429bd314 remains historical and Linux packaging in progress; not needed to combine with current-main evidence., custody_refresh=Issue #1 last updated 2026-10-22T22:08:35Z. No custodian response; 40-task manifest custody acceptance and compatibility remain external blocker. No held-out\\n[Response shortened; request fewer selected records for more detail.]\"}]}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"b0204c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.361295592,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":457,\"output\":\"1670601    6852       05:50 /usr/bin/zsh -c set -eu suite=/var/tmp/nexus-pr200-rebased-build test_home=$(mktemp -d /var/tmp/nexus-pr200-exact-suite-home.XXXXXX) logfile=$(mktemp /var/tmp/nexus-pr200-exact-make-test.XXXXXX.log) cd \\\"$suite\\\" export HOME=\\\"$test_home\\\" XDG_CONFIG_HOME=\\\"$test_home/.config\\\" XDG_CACHE_HOME=\\\"$test_home/.cache\\\" CARGO_HOME=/home/mike/.cargo RUSTUP_HOME=/home/mike/.rustup CARGO_TARGET_DIR=\\\"$suite/core/target\\\" export PATH=\\\"/home/mike/.cargo/bin:/home/mike/.local/bin:/home/mike/go/bin:$PATH\\\" if make test >\\\"$logfile\\\" 2>&1; then tail -70 \\\"$logfile\\\"; printf '\\\\nRESULT=PASS log=%s home=%s snapshot=%s\\\\n' \\\"$logfile\\\" \\\"$test_home\\\" \\\"$suite\\\"; else statu