quest: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent custodian verifies completeness, coverage, integrity, and execution-boundary separation.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\"}],\"number\":1,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"PLAN-10 task 8: finish and seal the held-out T2/T3 corpus\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\"}\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","create_time":1792886188.0958054}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
