{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T01:03:13.577Z","ordinal":316633,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1703b-4280-7320-9374-5c397c112b4d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-2566d381-502e-4881-b089-d7230b41a0a7","process_id":"55042","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","git fetch origin main --quiet && printf 'REMOTE_MAIN ' && git rev-parse origin/main && printf 'BRANCH_HEAD ' && git rev-parse codex/startup-folder-trust-copy && printf 'MERGE_BASE ' && git merge-base origin/main codex/startup-folder-trust-copy && git log --oneline --decorate --graph --left-right origin/main...codex/startup-folder-trust-copy | head -45 && gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,url --limit 100 | jq '.[] | select((.headRefName|test(\"trust|startup\";\"i\")) or (.title|test(\"trust|startup\";\"i\")))' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy show --stat --oneline 29891188e580c774194f68ef006415183a1c27cf && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy diff --stat origin/main...HEAD"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"git fetch origin main --quiet && printf 'REMOTE_MAIN ' && git rev-parse origin/main && printf 'BRANCH_HEAD ' && git rev-parse codex/startup-folder-trust-copy && printf 'MERGE_BASE ' && git merge-base origin/main codex/startup-folder-trust-copy && git log --oneline --decorate --graph --left-right origin/main...codex/startup-folder-trust-copy | head -45 && gh pr list --state open --json number,title,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,url --limit 100 | jq '.[] | select((.headRefName|test(\"trust|startup\";\"i\")) or (.title|test(\"trust|startup\";\"i\")))' && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy show --stat --oneline 29891188e580c774194f68ef006415183a1c27cf && git -C /home/mike/nexus-wt/startup-folder-trust-copy diff --stat origin/main...HEAD"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"REMOTE_MAIN c1f40e51b4d29b7110456b80e71984a31020eef3\nBRANCH_HEAD 29891188e580c774194f68ef006415183a1c27cf\nMERGE_BASE 29891188e580c774194f68ef006415183a1c27cf\n<   c1f40e5 (origin/main) Merge pull request #206 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-repl-readonly\n|\\  \n| < e11115c (origin/v1/defect-repl-readonly, v1/defect-repl-readonly) docs(repl): scope read-only mode wording and residual list\n| < 2f35144 fix(repl): gate mode-selected read-only and cover command variants\n| < 0733676 fix(repl): refuse mutating slash commands in read-only mode\n|/  \n<   c1b1332 Merge pull request #205 from mikeholownych/v1/defect-tar-ambient-env\n|\\  \n| < 010caad (origin/v1/defect-tar-ambient-env, v1/defect-tar-ambient-env) fix(upgrade): sanitize PATH for tar and fail closed without it\n| < 2247540 fix(upgrade): extract archives with a trusted tar and environment\n< 2ab20cd Merge pull request #204 from mikeholownych/codex/startup-folder-trust-copy-20261024\n{\n  \"baseRefName\": \"main\",\n  \"headRefName\": \"dependabot/npm_and_yarn/experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/trusted-broker-bundle/cf-1.0.0-beta.18\",\n  \"headRefOid\": \"57fc446983675d78d89fa391153ead02071e4ba7\",\n  \"number\": 109,\n  \"title\": \"build(deps): bump cf from 1.0.0-beta.10 to 1.0.0-beta.18 in /experiments/cloudflare-artifacts-vertical-slice/trusted-broker-bundle\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/109\"\n}\n2989118 test(requirements): use literal verifier evidence title\n cli/test/verifier_gating.test.ts | 118 +++++++++++++++++++--------------------\n docs/v1.0.0/REQUIREMENTS.md      |   2 +-\n 2 files changed, 60 insertions(+), 60 deletions(-)\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":6673641}},"started_at_ms":1792890192569,"completed_at_ms":1792890193577}}
