{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T01:05:55.051Z","ordinal":316760,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17097-bd6b-7c31-97a8-7f7352ee62d6","call_id":"call_df517a57a208477994acbe1417595ec8","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__acknowledge_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nAcknowledge a message addressed to an agent (and mark as read).\\n\\nBehavior\\n---\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__archive_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSoft-delete a project: mark it as archived so it is hidden from active projec\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__create_agent_identity\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nCreate a new, unique agent identity and persist its profile to Git.\\n\\nHow this\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__deregister_agent\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRemove an agent from a project. Marks the agent as inactive and removes it fr\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__ensure_project\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nIdempotently create or ensure a project exists for the given human key.\\n\\nWhen\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__expire_window\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nMark a window identity as expired.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_inbox\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve recent messages for an agent without mutating read/ack state.\\n\\nFilte\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : \"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_topic\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents