026-10-24T21:32:30Z FOREIGN_SUITE_ORPHAN_RECHECK: Parent agent PID1969096 is absent; make test PID850189 and test runner PID868748 remain live under PID1 on boot 8928bf1f, cwd defect-latest-resume-corruption-snapshot@27415c892fe0e20188b38a1653090b8c231ff788. No claim matches this snapshot. No process signaled or adopted. SUITE coordination lock remains.\n3728:2026-10-24T21:34:02Z STARTUP_FOLDER_TRUST_COPY_20261024 CHECKPOINT: exact branch head ca2865fcf5251015f8eba05525d53b6fe1b96243 on base origin/main=4b474f1638645258fc6bc696400892feaf3a78d6. Effect-specific headless egress guidance + regression test. Focused approval/config/startup/verifier tests 38/38 PASS under isolated HOME; tsc --noEmit PASS; npm run build PASS; diff-check PASS. Independent read-only review ACCEPT exact HEAD by plan05_readonly_review, diff SHA-256 3492fafded257cba75428f1ab66fcc700c9e99372a68fad72d73018d313684c3. Requirements --enforce still fails only REQ-SEC-101 and REQ-SEC-119, both partial; narrow test evidence does not promote them. Hot-file claim FILE_cli_src_agent.ts released after review. Candidate ready for owner integration; no push, PR, or release action taken.\n3732:2026-10-24T21:50:00Z SUITE_RECOVERY: verified on mike-dev that the previously reported local make test PID850189 and runner PID868748 are absent; classify that run INCOMPLETE, not pass/fail. Updated SUITE ownership to track exact-main CI40133356557 at 4b474f1638645258fc6bc696400892feaf3a78d6; Node22/24 passed, linux-x86_64 still running npm CLI test. No overlapping candidate suite launched.\n3733:2026-10-24T21:51:19Z claude-code INDEPENDENT_REVIEW STARTUP_FOLDER_TRUST_COPY_20261024 head=5b8f4ebf68fd9c5d016f342a1a7c5e948e20b16f (branch codex/startup-folder-trust-copy-20261024, base 4b474f1): REQUEST_CHANGES (gate only; code reviewed and sound). CODE: trust no longer selects approval mode (config/repl/sidecar/doctor/agent default to review unless fullAccess); auto mode no longer asks for exec in untrusted workspaces; cont