{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T01:42:16.532Z","ordinal":318619,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17095-f2fe-7de0-b5cc-460661bc1fe3","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-dc1ad033-47e0-45c4-86b2-28138e328dff","process_id":"5605","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","cat > /tmp/nexus-sec101-119-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Route TUI `/test` through the same verifier approval policy and one-time script disclosure as the REPL, and propagate cancellation to the runner.\n- Add actual-launch PTY coverage for `nexus` and `nexus repl` across trusted/untrusted workspaces, explicit `review`/`auto`, and unset mode (default review).\n- Verify `/test` trust independence, bwrap workspace execution, and Escape cancellation with a host-visible descendant-process canary.\n- Record exact source evidence and update REQ-SEC-101/119 from partial to tested for the source gate only. Exact-RC, held-out, cross-runner, and human terminal qualification remain pending.\n\n## Validation\n\n- ACC-SAFE-01 PTY case: 1/1 passed, covering all 12 launch combinations.\n- ACC-SAFE-09/10 PTY case: 1/1 passed, including pre-cancel sleep-process identity and post-cancel absence.\n- `npm run build` in `cli/`: passed.\n- `node scripts/check_requirements.mjs --enforce`: passed on the clean candidate, 108 tested, 6 partial, 2 implemented, 7 open, with 12 exact-RC deferrals.\n- `git diff --check` and Python helper compilation: passed.\n- Independent code and evidence/ledger reviews: ACCEPT.\n\nNo full local suite was run; exact-head CI is required before merge.\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head v1/plan-01-sec101-119-pty-followup --title \"fix: gate and cancel TUI verifier runs\" --body-file /tmp/nexus-sec101-119-pr-body.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/sec101-119-pty-followup","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cat > /tmp/nexus-sec101-119-pr-body.md <<'EOF'\n## Summary\n\n- Route TUI `/test` through the same ve