P.\ncli/src/startup_trust.ts:132:        \"Trust this folder?\",\ncli/src/knowledge.ts:211:   * Gated by workspace trust: returns empty string if workspace is untrusted (REQ-SEC-113).\ncli/src/knowledge.ts:238:   * Gated by workspace trust and read-only mode.\ncli/src/index.ts:288:  .option(\"--mode <mode>\", \"Execution mode: auto, review, or read-only (default: review; folder trust does not change it)\")\ncli/src/index.ts:353:  .option(\"--mode <mode>\", \"Execution mode: auto, review, or read-only (default: review; folder trust does not change it)\")\ncli/src/index.ts:385:  .option(\"--mode <mode>\", \"Execution mode: auto, review, or read-only (default: review; folder trust does not change it)\")\ncli/src/types.ts:61:  approvalMode?: \"auto\" | \"review\" | \"read-only\"; // Permission posture: auto, review, or read-only (DEC-01, independent of folder trust)\ncli/src/skills.ts:64:    // Project workspace locations (gated by workspace trust)\ncli/src/core/approval_policy.ts:23:   * Permission mode controls tool approvals independently of workspace trust:\ncli/src/core/approval_policy.ts:26:   * - Untrusted context sources remain distinguishable from workspace trust.\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":697751714}},"started_at_ms":1792893826298,"completed_at_ms":1792893826996}}
