{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:18:38.906Z","ordinal":320039,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add66fc41d081a093a14bd78d22fb83","status":"completed","call_id":"call_58cbb72ffb884c8493159631b9a5288d","name":"exec","input":"const patch = \"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /home/mike/nexus-wt/sec101-119-pty-followup/docs/reviews/evidence/v1-qualification/sec101-119-pty-20261025.md\\n@@\\n This revalidation confirms source-level evidence on the rebased candidate only. It does not satisfy exact-RC, held-out, cross-runner, or human terminal qualification.\\n+\\n+## CI-exposed PTY matcher correction\\n+\\n+PR CI run `40152382285` on candidate `9a27e194050aa8089de4fe28537e5f8e564b7452` failed the new `ACC-SAFE-09/10` PTY case on Node 22 and Node 24 because the helper expected terminal output with spaces removed, while `/test` renders `Test suite passed.` and `Test suite failed.`. No product behavior failure was established by that run.\\n+\\n+The test helper was corrected in source commit `93d0fa49e7f4528191e3c01b7870b09f12f35b84`. It now scopes pass-result matching to output received since `/test` was invoked and cancellation-result matching to output received since Escape was sent, preventing older transcript text from satisfying the result check. The focused `ACC-SAFE-09/10` PTY test passed 1/1 in 41.8 seconds with isolated `HOME` and `XDG_CONFIG_HOME`; Python compilation and `git diff --check` passed. Independent read-only review disposition: **ACCEPT**.\\n+\\n+This is a local source-test result on commit `93d0fa49e7f4528191e3c01b7870b09f12f35b84`; fresh exact-head hosted CI is still required. Exact-RC, held-out, cross-runner, and human terminal qualification remain pending.\\n \\n ## Disposition\\n*** End Patch\";\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(patch));","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a170d0-7672-79e2-b11d-117e84b3ea44","create_time":1792894716.2582896}}}
