{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:27:25.095Z","ordinal":320716,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a170e2-5b27-76b1-b625-bd2207059f9b","call_id":"call_94e483f4723547c6bcaa21615e768304","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__fetch_summary\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nRetrieve stored project-wide summaries.\\n\\nParameters\\n----------\\nproject_key : str\\n    Project identifier.\\nsince_hours : float\\n    Return summaries whose end_ts is within this window (default 24h).\\nlimit : int\\n    Maximum summari\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nList contact links for an agent in a project.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_agent_mail__list_contacts(args: { agent_name: string; format?: string | null; project_key: string; registration_token?:\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__search_messages\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nFull-text search over subject and body for a project.\\n\\nTips\\n----\\n- SQLite FTS5 syntax supported: phrases (\\\"build plan\\\"), prefix (mig*), boolean (plan AND users)\\n- Results are ordered by bm25 score (best matches first)\\n- Limit d\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_agent_mail__send_message\",\"description\":\"You are the MCP Agent Mail coordination server. Provide message routing, coordination tooling, and project context to cooperating agents. Outputs are JSON by default; pass format='toon' (or set MCP_AGENT_MAIL_OUTPUT_FORMAT=toon) to receive {format:'toon', data:'<TOON>'}.\\n\\nSend a Markdown message to one or more recipients and persist canonical and mailbox copies to Git.\\n\\nDiscovery\\n---------\\nTo discover available agent names for recipients, use: resource://agents/{project_key}\\nAgent names are NOT \"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a170d0-7672-79e2-b11d-117e84b3ea44","create_time":1792895245.0957544}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
