{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T02:40:12.596Z","ordinal":321238,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a170d0-7672-79e2-b11d-117e84b3ea44","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8491d7f1-7c25-46f5-ba84-0ca70fdbaaa1","process_id":"84887","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 210 --json title,body,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-wt/sec101-119-pty-followup","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 210 --json title,body,state,headRefName,headRefOid,baseRefName,baseRefOid,mergeStateStatus,reviewDecision,statusCheckRollup,url"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"main\",\"baseRefOid\":\"19b30a4c92b8dd2c891c5b7a5b67db319ee9ee7f\",\"body\":\"## Defect\\n\\nWith `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`, upgrade ran attestation only if `spawnSync(\\\"gh\\\", [\\\"--version\\\"])` succeeded. A missing `gh` skipped the required check entirely (fail-open), and `gh` was resolved from ambient `PATH`, so a shim that exits 0 could claim verification without a real check.\\n\\n## Fix\\n\\nResolve `gh` only at `/usr/bin/gh` or `/usr/local/bin/gh`. If verification is required and no trusted `gh` exists, fail the upgrade with an explicit error. `auto` still skips when absent; a trusted `gh` reporting failed attestation still fails required mode.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- New acceptance test with a PATH `gh` shim and `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`: fails on base (upgrade succeeds), passes after.\\n- Full `upgrade_acceptance.test.ts` 7/7; `tsc`; `git diff --check`.\\n- Evidence: `docs/reviews/evidence/v1/DEFECT-UPGRADE-ATTESTATION-20261025/README.md`.\\n\\n## Residuals\\n\\n`gh` outside the two trusted paths is ignored; `auto` remains optional; the trusted binary itself is assumed provisioned by the OS.\\n\\n## Coordination\\n\\nUnclaimed slice. Independent review and exact-head CI to follow.\",\"headRefName\":\"v1/defect-upgrade-attestation\",\"headRefOid\":\"94ad942bd492ee6586bf73a595bbb642f8f73757\",\"mergeStateStatus\":\"BLOCKED\",\"reviewDecision\":\"\",\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40155279776/job/121055258119\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:39:30Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40155279607/job/121055257491\",\"name\":\"javascript-typescript\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:39:29Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CodeQL\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40155279776/job/121055258291\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:39:29Z\",\"status\":\"IN_PROGRESS\",\"workflowName\":\"CI\"},{\"__typename\":\"StatusContext\",\"context\":\"CodeRabbit\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:39:33Z\",\"state\":\"SUCCESS\",\"targetUrl\":\"\"}],\"title\":\"fix(upgrade): fail closed when required attestation has no trusted gh\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/mikeholownych/nexus-code/pull/210\"}\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":1,"nanos":910380358}},"started_at_ms":1792896010685,"completed_at_ms":1792896012596}}
