{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:23:40.644Z","ordinal":322128,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a170f2-3e90-7ad2-8d66-c8179982613b","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-c17a1b1c-cbbf-474e-9d93-22c73ba29397","process_id":"99251","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40155279776 --jq '{id,run_attempt,status,conclusion,created_at,run_started_at,updated_at,head_sha,event,actor:.actor.login}' && gh run view 40155279776 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '{status,conclusion,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion,startedAt,completedAt,steps:[.steps[]|select(.status==\"in_progress\")|{name,number}]}]}' && gh run view 40156576300 --json status,jobs --jq '{status,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion,steps:[.steps[]|select(.status==\"in_progress\")|{name,number}]}]}' && gh pr view 210 --json comments --jq '.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh api repos/mikeholownych/nexus-code/actions/runs/40155279776 --jq '{id,run_attempt,status,conclusion,created_at,run_started_at,updated_at,head_sha,event,actor:.actor.login}' && gh run view 40155279776 --json status,conclusion,jobs --jq '{status,conclusion,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion,startedAt,completedAt,steps:[.steps[]|select(.status==\"in_progress\")|{name,number}]}]}' && gh run view 40156576300 --json status,jobs --jq '{status,jobs:[.jobs[]|{name,status,conclusion,steps:[.steps[]|select(.status==\"in_progress\")|{name,number}]}]}' && gh pr view 210 --json comments --jq '.comments[-3:]|map({author:.author.login,createdAt,body})'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"{\"actor\":\"mikeholownych\",\"conclusion\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-10-25T02:39:27Z\",\"event\":\"pull_request\",\"head_sha\":\"94ad942bd492ee6586bf73a595bbb642f8f73757\",\"id\":40155279776,\"run_attempt\":2,\"run_started_at\":\"2026-10-25T02:55:20Z\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-25T03:12:55Z\"}\n{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"jobs\":[{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:11:04Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:55:23Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"completedAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:12:53Z\",\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:55:23Z\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"completedAt\":\"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:12:55Z\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli test\",\"number\":18}]}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}\n{\"jobs\":[{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (24)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"conclusion\":\"success\",\"name\":\"test-matrix (22)\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"steps\":[]},{\"conclusion\":\"\",\"name\":\"linux-x86_64\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"steps\":[{\"name\":\"Run npm --prefix cli test\",\"number\":18}]}],\"status\":\"in_progress\"}\n[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Run `40155279776` is now terminal `cancelled` (Node 22, Node 24, and Linux package jobs all canceled); it is not qualification evidence. This leaves PR #209 `40153999710` as the sole active full-suite lane. Once #209 completes and integrates, I will rebase #210 on the new `main` and run exact-head CI then.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:50:05Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"**Independent review (claude-code) at exact head `94ad942bd492ee6586bf73a595bbb642f8f73757` (base `19b30a4`): ACCEPT, with two non-blocking follow-ups.**\\n\\nThe fix is correct:\\n- `gh` is no longer resolved from PATH, so a shim that exits 0 can't produce `attestationVerified = true`.\\n- With `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` and no trusted `gh`, the upgrade fails **before** any download or journal staging. The in-flow branch also fails closed, which covers a trusted path that disappears mid-run.\\n- Both the archive and the `SHA256SUMS` attestation must pass.\\n\\nFollow-ups:\\n1. **Silent downgrade in `auto` mode.** Only `/usr/bin/gh` and `/usr/local/bin/gh` are trusted. Users whose `gh` lives at `/snap/bin/gh`, `/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/gh` or `~/.local/bin/gh` used to get verification through PATH and now get none. `attestationVerified` stays `undefined`, and nothing in `cli/src` outside `upgrade.ts` reads it, so the user isn't told. Suggest an `onProgress`/notice line such as \\\"provenance attestation not checked: no trusted gh found (set NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1 to require it)\\\". Consider adding `/snap/bin/gh` (root-owned) to the default list.\\n2. **Environment hardening.** `spawnSync(trustedGh, …)` inherits the caller's environment, so `GH_HOST` and similar variables can point `gh` at a different API host. Sigstore signature and identity checks should still reject forged bundles, but passing an explicit minimal env (or deleting `GH_HOST`/`GH_ENTERPRISE_TOKEN`) would keep the verification target fixed to github.com.\\n\\nThis is user-visible (upgrade behaviour with `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1`), so it needs an rc.5 notes bullet if it merges before the tag.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T02:51:26Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"PR #209 is now merged as `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca`. The exact PR #209 workflow completed successfully before merge. I will let the exact `main` checks for `4e7297f` finish before rebasing #210 and starting its next full suite, keeping the suite lane serialized.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-25T03:00:25Z\"}]\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":3,"nanos":43666607}},"started_at_ms":1792898617600,"completed_at_ms":1792898620644}}
