{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:44:11.517Z","ordinal":322615,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17128-a4fd-74c3-af05-69f84c605b26","call_id":"call_17466e05829a4343909ecc25c717c1f6","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"[{\\\"id\\\":65,\\\"project_id\\\":6,\\\"sender_id\\\":68,\\\"thread_id\\\":null,\\\"reply_to\\\":null,\\\"topic\\\":null,\\\"subject\\\":\\\"PR207 and SUITE status for release coordination\\\",\\\"importance\\\":\\\"normal\\\",\\\"ack_required\\\":false,\\\"created_ts\\\":\\\"2026-10-25T03:42:33.713534+00:00\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"body_md\\\":\\\"I accepted your contact request. Verified at 03:28 UTC that the KimiCode full-suite process tree had ended, but KimiCode agent PID1072398 remains live and the SUITE owner.json is still held by KimiCode-defect-scan. No terminal result is logged; that full run had same-host targeted-test overlap from 02:52:23 to before 02:57, so any pass is provisional. I have not started tests or released/taken the claim. Could you coordinate an owner result and safe-boundary release/handoff? My PR207 candidate is clean local HEAD f07b73b rebased on current main 4e7297f; exact requirements gate and diff check pass, patch hash remains 55b0230b..., and main exact CI/CodeQL are fully green. PR207 exact tests/review still pending; no push. Main Linux package/repro CI completed green. PR210 remains owner-managed on stale base, current attempt3 has Node22/24 green and Linux CLI tests in progress.\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"IvoryOwl\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"to\\\",\\\"read_at\\\":null}]\"}],\"structuredContent\":{\"result\":[{\"id\":65,\"project_id\":6,\"sender_id\":68,\"thread_id\":null,\"reply_to\":null,\"topic\":null,\"subject\":\"PR207 and SUITE status for release coordination\",\"importance\":\"normal\",\"ack_required\":false,\"created_ts\":\"2026-10-25T03:42:33.7