{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:44:44.983Z","ordinal":322637,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a17129-27b7-7511-9069-0849204567ee","call_id":"call_f7dc2f3c49ca48f2a9c1572b4311abbd","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"[{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__search\",\"description\":\"Smart search (default), step 1: search memory for an index with IDs. Review it, use timeline for context, then get_observations only for selected IDs. Params: query, limit, project, platformSource, type, obs_type, dateStart, dateEnd, offset, orderBy. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__search(args: {\\n  // End date filter (ISO)\\n  dateEnd?: string;\\n  // Start date filter (ISO)\\n  dateStart?: string;\\n  // Max results (default 20)\\n  limit?: number;\\n  // Filter observations by their type (e.g. bugfix, feature). Comma-separated for multiple.\\n  obs_type?: string;\\n  // Pagination offset\\n  offset?: number;\\n  // Sort order: date_desc or date_asc\\n  orderBy?: string;\\n  // Filter by platform source (e.g. claude, codex, cursor) — restricts results to that agent's own memory\\n  platformSource?: string;\\n  // Worker project name\\n  project?: string;\\n  // Server project ID; defaults to the configured server project\\n  projectId?: string;\\n  // Search query\\n  query?: string;\\n  // Document category to search: 'observations', 'sessions', or 'prompts' (default: all). Any other value is treated as an observation-type filter (alias for obs_type).\\n  type?: string;\\n  [key: string]: unknown;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"},{\"name\":\"mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read\",\"description\":\"Read this project's to-do lists and working state written with work_state_write: every open item, or one list, with done and dropped items when includeClosed is true. Params: list, includeClosed. This tool is part of plugin `claude-mem`.\\n\\nexec tool declaration:\\n```ts\\ndeclare const tools: { mcp__mcp_search__work_state_read(args: {\\n  // Also show done and dropped items and closed lists\\n  includeClosed?: boolean;\\n  // Read only this list\\n  list?: string;\\n}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };\\n```\"}]"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a170f2-3e90-7ad2-8d66-c8179982613b","create_time":1792899884.983492}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
