{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:54:44.198Z","ordinal":323028,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1712a-1b5f-7ee1-86db-15241cee962c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7d8353f481a0913d10a3bfd89132","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I confirmed the suite is still active; its current worker had been blocked on filesystem journal writes, so I left that claim and processes untouched. For PR #210, I posted the completed old-base CI result and requested an explicit safe-boundary rebase or handoff from its live owner. While those two lanes continue, I’m checking the RC packaging path so the next candidate can be prepared as soon as the source blockers clear."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792900483351,"completed_at_ms":1792900484198}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:54:44.204Z","ordinal":323029,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7d8353f481a0913d10a3bfd89132","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I confirmed the suite is still active; its current worker had been blocked on filesystem journal writes, so I left that claim and processes untouched. For PR #210, I posted the completed old-base CI result and requested an explicit safe-boundary rebase or handoff from its live owner. While those two lanes continue, I’m checking the RC packaging path so the next candidate can be prepared as soon as the source blockers clear.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1712a-1b5f-7ee1-86db-15241cee962c","create_time":1792900483.3302217,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7d8353f481a0913d10a3bfd89132","turn_id":"01a1712a-1b5f-7ee1-86db-15241cee962c","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17132-4c6c-7d21-bb9b-c322235f2038","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16248}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:54:47.868Z","ordinal":323030,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_060b64278a9dfb15016add7d842cbc81a0aff415c18e33d36d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_8002aa39022c423ca0304f4df9d1558b","name":"exec","input":"const r=await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"wt=/home/mike/nexus-wt/git-exclude-fail-closed; echo '--- version fields at current main ---'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" show 4e7297f:package.json | jq -r '.version'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" show 4e7297f:cli/package.json | jq -r '.version'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" show 4e7297f:core/Cargo.toml | rg '^version\\\\s*=' | head -1; echo '--- release workflow files ---'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" ls-tree -r --name-only 4e7297f .github/workflows scripts docs/releases | rg '(release|version|package-linux|installer|rc)' | head -60; echo '--- workflow and version helper refs ---'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" grep -n -E 'tag_name|release|npm|sync-version|v1\\\\.0\\\\.0-rc' 4e7297f -- .github/workflows/release* scripts/sync-version.mjs docs/releases 2>/dev/null | head -110; echo '--- tags ---'; git -C \\\"$wt\\\" tag --list 'v1.0.0*' --sort=-version:refname | head -10; echo '--- current package release metadata ---'; gh release view v1.0.0-rc.4 --json tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets --jq '{tagName,isPrerelease,isDraft,publishedAt,url,assets:[.assets[].name]}'\",\"workdir\":\"/home/mike/nexus-code\",\"yield_time_ms\":10000,\"max_output_tokens\":2200});text(r.output)\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1712a-1b5f-7ee1-86db-15241cee962c","create_time":1792900484.1790717}}}
