{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:55:47.500Z","ordinal":323058,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a1712a-1b5f-7ee1-86db-15241cee962c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7dc0eac481a0b40f36a93e474801","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"### Current checkpoint — `NEXUS_V1_CONVERGENCE_ACTIVE`\n\n`origin/main` is still `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca`. Its exact CI run `40156576300` and CodeQL run `40156576296` passed.\n\n- **PR #207:** The rebased candidate `f07b73bc` received a fresh independent **ACCEPT** against that exact main revision. Its diff hash is `55b0230b…503de7a`. I recorded the review in the claims ledger. Tests and pushing remain pending the active exclusive suite.\n- **Suite lane:** Kimi’s serial suite is live and progressing through snapshots. I did not take the claim or start overlapping tests.\n- **PR #210:** CI and CodeQL passed on `94ad942`, but that candidate is based on older `19b30a4`. I posted a safe-boundary request asking its live owner to rebase or explicitly transfer the implementation and SPEC-12 claims. No takeover has occurred.\n- **Release:** RC4 remains the latest prerelease; no RC5 or stable release exists. The release workflow requires a tag-matched version and notes, and the approved target is the GitHub installer—not npm.\n- **Remaining acceptance blockers:** Held-out custody still lacks a custodian response; exact-RC qualification and the real five-environment, three-size terminal matrix remain outstanding. Acceptance stays **IN_PROGRESS**.\n\nI left the shared dirty checkout unchanged. Evidence and coordination records are in the [claims ledger](/home/mike/nexus-code/.git/nexus-claims.log). The release campaign remains active."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"started_at_ms":1792900544930,"completed_at_ms":1792900547500}}
