{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T03:56:13.831Z","ordinal":323073,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17133-8e81-7852-ba2f-5c66ceb95373","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-046d2b14-0689-4a43-9eb4-5bcbfbb3885f","process_id":"9906","command":["/usr/bin/zsh","-lc","gh release list --limit 3; gh issue view 1 --json updatedAt,comments --jq '{updatedAt,lastComments:[.comments[-2:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}'"],"cwd":"file:///home/mike/nexus-code","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh release list --limit 3; gh issue view 1 --json updatedAt,comments --jq '{updatedAt,lastComments:[.comments[-2:][]|{author:.author.login,createdAt,body}]}'"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"v1.0.0-rc.4\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.4\t2026-10-24T11:54:37Z\nv1.0.0-rc.3\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.3\t2026-10-23T09:06:11Z\nv1.0.0-rc.1\tPre-release\tv1.0.0-rc.1\t2026-10-21T18:54:41Z\n{\"lastComments\":[{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Metadata-only custody status request: please confirm the current author/custodian owner and progress toward the 40-task corpus, including coverage/validation counts, setup and reference-validation status, private digest re-derivation, store and parent access controls, exposure-history review, immutable seal status, and expected custody acceptance. Please do not post task prompts, answers, validators, or other protected payloads here. Held-out qualification remains blocked until the independent custodian verifies completeness, coverage, integrity, and execution-boundary separation.\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-24T02:16:57Z\"},{\"author\":\"mikeholownych\",\"body\":\"Release convergence update (public metadata only): post-merge CI and CodeQL now pass on current main `4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca` (CI run `40156576300`, CodeQL run `40156576296`). RC4 remains the newest prerelease; no stable release or final-candidate qu