local candidate f07b73b clean, requirements check and diff check pass, patch digest unchanged; tests/review await safe SUITE release.\n2026-10-25T03:42:33Z COORDINATION_HANDOFF_REQUEST_SENT: Registered IvoryOwl and accepted contact request from active release coordinator EmeraldOtter. Sent detailed status requesting owner-controlled Kimi SUITE result and safe-boundary release/handoff. Recipient: EmeraldOtter. No suite owner claim changed.\n2026-10-25T03:42:33Z MAIN_POSTMERGE_CI_TERMINAL: GitHub run40156576300 SUCCESS exact main4e7297f545538e6422ca3890334a7036f58287ca; Node22, Node24, and Linux x86-64 all pass including npm CLI tests, package/repro/install smoke. CodeQL40156576296 SUCCESS. This closes current post-PR209 source CI gate; does not constitute RC qualification or publication.\n2026-10-25T03:44:54Z KIMI_SUITE_RESULT_VERIFIED_READONLY: Verified worktree /home/mike/nexus-wt/defect-latest-resume-corruption at clean HEAD31ea276c30d8c3f10e4a4caf0c908dd291f54d16, commit 03:30:07 +0000 `docs: record corrupt resume suite result`; its README records snapshot `make test` on 27415c8 failed, 1,660/1,663 passing, 3 failures (evaluator resource-order fixture, CI-only capped-storage prerequisite, intermittent upgrade download); it does not claim full-suite pass. Prior same-host targeted-test overlap remains. Independently verified referenced fixture commit36b702f is not an ancestor of current origin/main4e7297f nor Kimi branch31ea276; therefore README's “already-fixed” phrasing is unproven for either current main or tested snapshot and was flagged to coordinator EmeraldOtter. The suite process tree is absent; Kimi agent PID1072398 remains live; SUITE owner.json still names KimiCode-defect-scan. No local tests started; no claim takeover/release.\n2026-10-25T03:49:07Z PR210_CI_PROGRESS: Latest attempt3 run40155279776 on exact head94ad942 has Node22/24 SUCCESS and Linux npm --prefix cli test completed; Linux package-linux.sh now in progress. PR210 remains owner-controlled a