{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:01:22.960Z","ordinal":323253,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a14cb3-25b0-7883-b3a1-0fa7cc559f92","turn_id":"01a17136-12b9-7661-904c-f2b43120b5c8","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7f121c2081a09e96bf60b2f58348","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I found a concrete source defect on the newly merged main: `install.sh` resolves `gh` through `PATH`, and when `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` but no `gh` is found, it skips verification instead of failing closed. That undermines the installer’s attestation path even though the CLI upgrade path was fixed. I’m checking the installer test and file claims, then I’ll implement a narrowly scoped correction in its own worktree; tests will wait for the active suite lane."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1792900882131,"completed_at_ms":1792900882959}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-25T04:01:22.963Z","ordinal":323254,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7f121c2081a09e96bf60b2f58348","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"I found a concrete source defect on the newly merged main: `install.sh` resolves `gh` through `PATH`, and when `NEXUS_VERIFY_ATTESTATION=1` but no `gh` is found, it skips verification instead of failing closed. That undermines the installer’s attestation path even though the CLI upgrade path was fixed. I’m checking the installer test and file claims, then I’ll implement a narrowly scoped correction in its own worktree; tests will wait for the active suite lane.","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"commentary","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a17136-12b9-7661-904c-f2b43120b5c8","create_time":1792900882.1122367,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_060b64278a9dfb15016add7f121c2081a09e96bf60b2f58348","turn_id":"01a17136-12b9-7661-904c-f2b43120b5c8","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a17138-6213-7e33-9db4-429deaec1943","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":16261}}
